<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK MAY 7 LIQUIDITY ESTIMATE FIM 2.15 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK MAY 7 LIQUIDITY ESTIMATE FIM 2.15 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance</p>
<p>for the rest of the month was 2.15 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for May 7			 2,150</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for May		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to May 4			    6,467</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,347</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
